{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>לעול</b> ם. Two plene occurrences here, and the other: 'you shall not seek their peace or their welfare all your days, לעולם' (Deuteronomy 23:7). And so it is in the Midrash: in the days of the Messiah, Moses will come and lead with him the wilderness generation. And so it comes to warn concerning the Ammonite and Moabite that we not seek their peace or their welfare לעולם."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:37.746300933Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}